At nine o'clock I arrive at the office.
Unfortunately, I am a little late.
I take off my jacket.
I hang up the jacket.
I walk to my desk.
My colleague Jonas is already there.
I greet him cheerfully.
"Good morning, Jonas!" I say.
"Good morning, Maya," he answers.
"How are you?" I ask.
"Good, and you?" he asks back.
"I am doing well too, thanks," I say.
I sit down at my desk.
I open my backpack.
I unpack my laptop.
I turn on the laptop.
Now I start my work.
Today we are writing code for a new project.
The work is fun.
